# @xlibraries packages come from GitHub Packages (docs/streams-plan.md §4). The token isn't set here (pnpm warns on
# every command when a variable in this file is unset): CI's setup-node writes it (NODE_AUTH_TOKEN); on your machine
# it's a line in ~/.npmrc, and on Vercel the NPM_RC variable (MIGRATION.md, "Needs you").
@xlibraries:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
